 :question/worked-solution "To find the points where the hyperbola intersects the line $x=1,$ we substitute $x=1$ into the equation of the hyperbola and solve for $y,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}25{x}^{2}-{y}^{2} & =26 \\\\ 25(1)^{2}-{y}^{2} & =26 \\\\ -{y}^{2} & =26-25 \\\\ -{y}^{2} & =1 \\\\ {y}^{2} & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe cannot take the square root of a negative number. Therefore, the equation has no real solutions. \nSo, the hyperbola does not intersect the vertical line $x=1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-8011/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "395f435d-473f-5dae-b215-2986556d5793"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-8011"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-278372/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "bc6c50c7-1b99-5401-b0cf-a510977d2868" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278372/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "56145521-71af-5b81-9804-9b98ea77e192" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278372/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "e419e8e8-fe9b-5dbc-9545-43db57f9c678" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-278372/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-field/choices ["q-278372/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" "q-278372/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-278372/field-2/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "74648690-266b-5eab-9b2e-8739537e97c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278372/field-2" :answer-