tersection are\n$x=-4$ and $x=4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-278383/field-1" "q-278383/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "55a53010-eddc-5115-8c70-0f32d0144384"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-278383"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-278375/field-1/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer/id #uuid "730c0f83-755b-5070-89cf-87b3254ec271" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278375/field-1/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "bae71417-2834-58a6-943c-7f0ad123769b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278375/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "8e1651f2-d37a-54c2-9114-eef3e43f2e83" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-278375/field-1/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer-field/choices ["q-278375/field-1/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" "q-278375/field-1/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-278375/field-2/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "3be5a155-b40c-5e7a-b681-207b7fa85dcf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278375/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "4edf9491-9b0f-5433-9cc4-2aaf28bc63a2" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-278375/field-2/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer-field/choices ["q-278375/field-2/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-278375" :question/id #uuid "5bea3b57-2a79-53a0-be43-d2e4d30fedc6" :question/math-academy-id "q-278375" :question/problem "In **ascending order,** the $x$-coordinates of the points where the hyperbola $\\frac{{y}^{2}}{8}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{16}=1$ intersects the line $y=-x$ are\n\n$\\,x=$\n{{field-1}}$\\,$ and $\\,x=$\n{{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "To find the points where the hyperbola intersects the line $y=-x,$ we first replace $y$ with $-x$ in the equation of the hyperbola and solve for $x,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{y}^{2}}{8}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{16} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(-x)^{2}}{8}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{16} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{8}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{16} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{2{x}^{2}}{16}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{16} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{16} & =1 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =16 \\\\ x & =\\pm 4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, in ascending order, the $x$-coordinates of the points of intersection are\n$x=-4$ and $x=4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-278375/field-1" "q-278375/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "55a53010-eddc-5115-8c70-0f32d0144384"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-278375"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-10492/selection/95fc9b70f54ebfab14bd403d9171fa4347035d03ec9ea352c993fd4b3bce585c" :answer/id #uuid "0c64b342-8f57-57c4-87db-cd82318080f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\pm \\sqrt{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10492/selection/35b7266b6d851ddea51fc4c30f17bef4ef406375eb2e896f3010b8d9da083bd7" :answer/id #uuid "1074f632-a3ec-55b4-b8e1-db665cc9fe57" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\pm 2\\sqrt{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10492/selection/0ee9ad77b56a0535d6153bfd8b2cc53c4932beef33dfb9416cfadcc84babf459" :answer/id #uuid "7f1db45f-077e-5add-b574-bc4b6678098a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\pm 5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10492/selection/067dd7799d77634cd4da5b4a854f62f71b1facce73b073408c5752722b0ff132" :answer/id #uuid "8